#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_sst_action_plan
msgid ""
"Within 12 months of the previous update: adjust the date to the plan's "
"anniversary. The workers designate a health and safety liaison officer (s. "
"97.1)."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_sst_prevention_program
msgid ""
"Within 12 months of the previous update: adjust the date to the program's "
"anniversary. The threshold is counted per establishment, loaned workers "
"included. Same threshold: a health and safety committee meeting at least "
"once per calendar quarter, a representative, and a report of priorities to "
"the CNESST every 3 years (s. 60)."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_coop_report_minister
msgid ""
"Within 30 days of the annual meeting, and to the federation if the "
"cooperative is a member. The deadline offered is the latest possible one; "
"move it to 30 days after the actual meeting date."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_req_annual_update
msgid ""
"Within 6 months of the end of the taxation year, for a legal person that "
"files a CO-17; none the year of registration. If nothing changed, the box of"
" the CO-17 is enough (s. 46). The 15 June date only concerns natural persons"
" and partnerships. A registered charity exempt from the CO-17 files from 15 "
"May to 15 November: read its date on the enterprise's statement of "
"information."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_spa_agm
msgid ""
"Within 6 months of the fiscal year end, since the financial statements "
"presented must be for a year ended in the previous 6 months (s. 225), and "
"within 15 months of the previous meeting (s. 163; first meeting: 18 months "
"from incorporation). A written resolution signed by all the voting "
"shareholders can take its place (s. 178). Notice: at least 10 days before "
"(s. 165)."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_coop_annual_report
msgid ""
"Within 6 months of the fiscal year end. It contains the financial "
"statements, the auditor's report and the date of the annual meeting."
msgstr ""

#. module: bf_corporate_governance
#: model:corporate.compliance.template,notes:bf_corporate_governance.tpl_qc_coop_agm
msgid ""
"Within 6 months of the fiscal year end. Mandatory agenda: auditor's report "
"and annual report, allocation of surplus, election of directors, appointment"
" of the auditor."
msgstr ""

